{
  "id": 514274357,
  "iid": 26021,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "ngsniffer: some length check cleanups.",
  "description": "If we have a rec_length_remaining count, always either do a checked\nsubtract of the amount to be read before doing the read, and if the\nchecked subtract fails, report an error, or do the subtract after the\nread if the length to read is known to be <= the remaining length.\n(That should ulimately become a pattern for readers.)\n\nMake some of these lengths unsigneds, to avoid worrying about the sign.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
